ud-khan-karrani">Daud Khan Karrani</a> is defeated at Rajmahal and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#bengal">Bengal</a> passes to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#mughal-empire">Mughals</a></span></li></ol>
